@startuml getApplicationNameAsync
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

title
getApplicationNameAsync – Retrieve Application Name
end title

participant "requestor" as requestor
participant "HTTP Client Interface" as hci #LightCyan
participant "JSON Driver" as jd #LightYellow
participant "config.json" as cfg #LightGrey

note over requestor
             HTTP client UUID
end note

requestor -> hci: (httpClientUuid)
activate hci

hci -> jd: read HTTP client interface list
activate jd

jd <-> cfg: retrieve control-construct

jd --> hci: HTTP client interface data
deactivate jd

note over hci
  <u>Processing</u>
  - Locate LTP with matching httpClientUuid  
  - Read attribute: application-name  
  - Return application name if present  
  - Return undefined if not found
end note

hci --> requestor: applicationName | undefined
deactivate hci

@enduml
